cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TeamStarWolf — An Open, Threat-Informed Cybersecurity Reference Library"
message: "If you use this library in your work, teaching, or research, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "TeamStarWolf"
    website: "https://github.com/TeamStarWolf"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TeamStarWolf/TeamStarWolf"
url: "https://teamstarwolf.github.io/TeamStarWolf/"
abstract: >-
  An open, MIT-licensed cybersecurity reference library of in-depth practitioner
  references, step-by-step how-to guides, and discipline learning paths, anchored
  to MITRE ATT&CK and mapped to NIST 800-53 controls, detections, D3FEND
  countermeasures, and the wider MITRE stack (ATLAS, Engage, F3, EMB3D, FiGHT,
  CWE, CAPEC), with machine-readable coverage datasets and ATT&CK Navigator layers.
keywords:
  - cybersecurity
  - threat-informed-defense
  - mitre-attack
  - detection-engineering
  - threat-intelligence
  - nist-800-53
  - blue-team
  - incident-response
  - vulnerability-management
license: MIT
